 proceeds via the intermediate compound alpha-D-glucose 1,6-bisphosphate (PubMed:17804405). In vitro, also has a low glucose 1,6-bisphosphate synthase activity which is most probably not physiologically relevant (PubMed:17804405, PubMed:18927083)."}],"uniprot_source":"UniProtKB/Swiss-Prot Function, release 2026_04","retrieved":"2026-10-21"}],"structures":[],"alphafold_accessions":[]}